============================
AV.ONE NAVSAT TRANSFORM NODE
============================

Command:
  ros2 launch avone_localisation navsat_transform.launch.py

What this launches:
  - Starts robot_localization navsat_transform_node
  - Loads config from:
      avone_localisation/config/navsat_transform.yaml
  - Converts GPS + IMU heading + reference odom into GPS-derived odometry on:
      /odometry/gps1

Notes:
  - Inputs are remapped to AV.ONE topics:
      gps/fix -> /fix
      imu     -> /imu_gps
      odometry/filtered -> /odometry/global1
  - Output is remapped:
      odometry/gps -> /odometry/gps1
  - Prints a LogInfo reminder to confirm the odometry/filtered remap

Individual Commands:

• NavSat Transform (robot_localization)
  - Produces GPS-based odometry for global fusion
  - Uses /fix, /imu_gps, and /odometry/global1 as inputs

  Command:
    ros2 run robot_localization navsat_transform_node \
      --ros-args \
      -p use_sim_time:=false \
      --params-file $(ros2 pkg prefix avone_localisation)/share/avone_localisation/config/navsat_transform.yaml \
      -r gps/fix:=/fix \
      -r imu:=/imu_gps \
      -r odometry/filtered:=/odometry/global1 \
      -r odometry/gps:=/odometry/gps1



